# Raider (R3, the Scavengers): flared long coat, a hook hand, rifle; a glowing magenta bandana (its light cue).
# Hit and run, loots the rubble, shoots at anyone.
name raider
grid 5
size 16 14 36
slot body InkBrown
slot coat Ink
slot band ScavMagenta
slot steel Steel
box 6 3 0 9 6 14 coat
box 6 8 0 9 11 14 coat
poly 10 27 coat 4,2 11,3 11,11 4,12
box 5 3 26 11 11 29 body
box 6 5 29 11 9 34 body
box 6 5 32 11 9 33 band
box 5 6 31 6 8 33 band
beam 8 12 27 13 13 20 1.1 body
box 13 12 18 15 13 21 steel
beam 8 2 27 14 2 23 1.1 steel
# Cue band round the chest, readable from every side (lineup2).
box 4 2 23 12 12 24 band
pivot 8 7 0
# R20 animation segments: legs below the coat hem swing from it, rifle and hook arms from the shoulders.
part LegL 0 0 0 16 7 10 7.5 4.5 10
part LegR 0 7 0 16 14 10 7.5 9.5 10
part ArmL 8 0 19 16 3 28 8 2 27
part ArmR 0 12 17 16 14 28 8 12 27
part Head 0 4 29 16 10 36 8 7 29
